																		{Seeking Greenlight} The Devil You Know
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/allecra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6964800); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6964800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605970384" alt="Allecra" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6964800)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/allecra" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6964800); return false;" >Allecra</a></span> <span class="odate time_1605912135 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">20 Nov 2020 22:42</span>
														</div>
