<p>Hi :)</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hope&nbsp;this&nbsp;helps&nbsp;:)</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>&quot;demonic humanoid&quot;</p>
<p>How is it demonic? What features make it demonic?</p>
<p>&quot;indirectly through secondhand description&quot;</p>
<p>How does the foundation contain this entity? How does the foundation ensure that reading the document doesn't cause its effects?</p>
<p>&quot;pre-existing mental manipulative effects placed upon any human’s psyche.&quot;</p>
<p>what is considered a pre-existing mental effect?</p>
<p>&quot;though anyone proven to acknowledge devil's existence from both direct or indirect sources can only be remedied with large doses of Class A amnestic&quot;</p>
<p>I think mentioning that the entity has some correlation with the devil as besides the name and this sentence the closest that the entity is related to the devil is being called a demon. I think that this is focusing a lot on that the entity is a demon I think that putting descriptions of what it looks like and its ability. I think that focusing on showing that its a demon and not tell will help a lot (I said the meme) and its something to think about when you are writing the article</p>
<p>&quot;The demon was borne out of an unknown man’s own sacrifice to ritualistically create something from the collective unconscious of humanity.&quot;</p>
<p>I like this as it creates the set up for this entity to be created on the idea of a man's efforts to create something to benefit humanity and it ultimately failing and creating something horrible I think that focusing on this could make for an interesting article</p>
<p>&quot;Subject finds mild entertainment in playing with the strings of the human mind &quot;</p>
<p>what is interesting to the entity? why does it like toying with the human mind? What is fun about it to them?</p>
</div>
